### Restore previous version (replace VERSION_ID with v1 id)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/blobs/report.txt/restore/VERSION_ID

### PIT restore request (admin - validated, then run CLI)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/restore/point-in-time
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restoreTime": "2026-09-20T14:30:00Z"
}

### PIT status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restore/status/pit-XXXX

### Real Azure PIT restore (admin, Storage Account Contributor required)
# az storage blob restore --account-name <storage-account> --resource-group <rg> --time "2026-09-20T14:30:00Z" --blob-range "data-protection/*"
